      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/4/msa@/~chp_II",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 103 Akta ibu dipinda—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/4/msa@/~chp_II__cl_12__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/4/msa@/~chp_II__cl_12",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam subseksyen (3), dengan menggantikan perkataan “Where” dengan perkataan “Subject to subsection (7), where”; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/4/msa@/~chp_II__cl_12__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/4/msa@/~chp_II__cl_12",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam subseksyen (7), dengan menggantikan perkataan “subsection (2)” dengan perkataan “subsection (1), (1a) or (2)”. Pindaan seksyen 107b"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/4/msa@/~chp_II__cl_13",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "13",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/4/msa@/~chp_II",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Proviso kepada subseksyen 107B(2) Akta ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan perkataan “not later than the thirtieth day of June” dengan perkataan “once not later than the thirtieth day of June or once not later than the thirty first day of October, or both”. Pindaan seksyen 107d"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/4/msa@/~chp_II__cl_14",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "14",
