        "@value": "dengan memasukkan selepas subperenggan (c) subperenggan yang berikut: “(d) twenty per cent of the capital contribution (whether in cash or in kind) of the limited liability partnership at the beginning of the basis period for a year of assessment is directly or indirectly contributed by one or more companies incorporated outside Malaysia or by one or more individuals who are not citizens of Malaysia.”; dan"
