        "@value": "dengan menggantikan perkataan “a self-employed person within the meaning of the Employees Provident Fund Act 1991 or a pensionable officer within the meaning of section 2 of the Pensions Act 1980” dengan perkataan “any individual”. Pindaan seksyen 77"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/4/msa@/~chp_II__cl_6",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "6",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/4/msa@/~chp_II",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 77 Akta ibu dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas subseksyen (1a) subseksyen yang berikut: “(1B) For the purposes of this section, the person referred to in subsection (1) shall furnish to the Director General a return in the prescribed form on an electronic medium or by way of electronic transmission in accordance with section 152a.”. Pindaan seksyen 77a"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/4/msa@/~chp_II__cl_7",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "7",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/4/msa@/~chp_II",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Subseksyen 77a(1a) Akta ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan perkataan “a company and a limited liability partnership” dengan perkataan “a company, limited liability partnership, trust body and co-operative society”. Pindaan seksyen 77b"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/4/msa@/~chp_II__cl_8",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "8",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/4/msa@/~chp_II",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 77B Akta ibu dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas subseksyen (1) subseksyen yang berikut: “(1a) For the purposes of this section, a person who is a company, limited liability partnership, trust body and co-operative society shall furnish to the Director General an amended return in the prescribed form on an electronic medium or by way of electronic transmission in accordance with section 152a.”. Pindaan seksyen 83"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/4/msa@/~chp_II__cl_9",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "9",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/4/msa@/~chp_II",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Subseksyen 83(1B) Akta ibu dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas perkataan “a company,” perkataan “limited liability partnership, trust body or co-operative society,”. Pindaan seksyen 86"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/4/msa@/~chp_I__cl_1",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/4/msa@/~chp_I",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta ini bolehlah dinamakan Akta Kewangan 2023. Pindaan Akta"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/4/msa@/~chp_I__cl_2",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/4/msa@/~chp_I",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta Cukai Pendapatan 1967 [Akta 53], Akta Cukai Keuntungan Harta Tanah 1976 [Akta 169], Akta Setem 1949 [Akta 378] dan Akta Petroleum (Cukai Pendapatan) 1967 [Akta 543] dipinda mengikut cara yang dinyatakan masing-masing dalam Bab II, III, IV dan V."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/4/msa@/~sched_2",
      "@type": "akn:schedule",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/4/msa@/~sched_2__chp_IV",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/4/msa@/~sched_2__chp_V"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/4/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "(a) dalam perenggan 3— (i) dalam subsubperenggan (1)(b)— (A) dalam subsubsubperenggan (i), dengan memotong perkataan “atau” di hujung subsubsubperenggan itu; (B) dengan memasukkan subsubsubperenggan (i) subsubsubperenggan yang berikut: “(ia) pemindahmilikan aset antara bekas suami isteri menurut suatu perintah oleh mana-mana mahkamah berikutan dengan pembubaran atau pembatalan perkahwinan mereka; atau”; dan (C) dalam subsubsubperenggan (ii), dengan menggantikan perkataan “kepada suatu syarikat yang bermastautin di Malaysia atau tidak” dengan perkataan “kepada suatu syarikat yang diperbadankan di Malaysia”; dan (ii) dalam subperenggan (2), dengan memasukkan selepas perkataan “suami isteri” perkataan “atau bekas suami isteri”; dan (b) dalam subperenggan 19(5), dengan menggantikan perkataan “oleh suami/isteri” dengan perkataan “oleh suami atau isteri atau bekas suami atau bekas isteri”."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/4/msa@/~sched_2__chp_IV",
      "@type": "akn:chapter",
      "eli:number": "IV",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/4/msa@/~sched_2__chp_IV__para_20",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/4/msa@/~sched_2__chp_IV__para_21"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/4/msa@/~sched_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "PINDAAN KEPADA AKTA SETEM 1949 Permulaan kuat kuasa pindaan kepada Akta Setem 1949"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/4/msa@/~sched_2__chp_IV__para_20",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "20",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/4/msa@/~sched_2__chp_IV__para_20__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/4/msa@/~sched_2__chp_IV__para_20__subsec_2"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/4/msa@/~sched_2__chp_IV"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/4/msa@/~sched_2__chp_IV__para_20__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/4/msa@/~sched_2__chp_IV__para_20",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Perenggan 21(a) mula berkuat kuasa pada 1 Jun 2023."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/4/msa@/~sched_2__chp_IV__para_20__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/4/msa@/~sched_2__chp_IV__para_20",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Perenggan 21 (b) dan (c) mula berkuat kuasa apabila berkuatkuasanya Akta ini. Pindaan Jadual Pertama"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/4/msa@/~sched_2__chp_IV__para_21",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "21",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/4/msa@/~sched_2__chp_IV__para_21__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/4/msa@/~sched_2__chp_IV__para_21__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/4/msa@/~sched_2__chp_IV__para_21__para_c"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/4/msa@/~sched_2__chp_IV",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta Setem 1949 dipinda dalam Jadual Pertama—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/4/msa@/~sched_2__chp_IV__para_21__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/4/msa@/~sched_2__chp_IV__para_21",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam subbutiran 22(4), dengan memasukkan selepas perkataan “higher educational institutions” perkataan “or pursuing any course of study in any institution”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/4/msa@/~sched_2__chp_IV__para_21__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/4/msa@/~sched_2__chp_IV__para_21",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam subbutiran 27(d), dengan memasukkan sebelum perkataan “, pursuant to an agreement for discounting invoices or hire purchase receivables” perkataan “or any statutory body, agency of the Government or of the State Government, or any company in which the Government or the State Government has interest, which provides financing to a small and medium enterprise”; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/4/msa@/~sched_2__chp_IV__para_21__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/4/msa@/~sched_2__chp_IV__para_21",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam subbutiran 32(c), dengan memasukkan sebelum perkataan “, pursuant to a factoring agreement” perkataan “or any statutory body, agency of the Government or of the State Government, or any company in which the Government or the State Government has interest, which provides financing to a small and medium enterprise”."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/4/msa@/~sched_2__chp_V",
      "@type": "akn:chapter",
      "eli:number": "V",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/4/msa@/~sched_2__chp_V__para_22",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/4/msa@/~sched_2__chp_V__para_23",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/4/msa@/~sched_2__chp_V__para_24",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/4/msa@/~sched_2__chp_V__para_25",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/4/msa@/~sched_2__chp_V__para_26",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/4/msa@/~sched_2__chp_V__para_27"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/4/msa@/~sched_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "PINDAAN KEPADA AKTA PETROLEUM (CUKAI PENDAPATAN) 1967 Permulaan kuat kuasa pindaan kepada Akta Petroleum (Cukai Pendapatan) 1967"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/4/msa@/~sched_2__chp_V__para_22",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "22",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/4/msa@/~sched_2__chp_V",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Bab ini berkuat kuasa bagi tahun taksiran 2023 dan tahun-tahun taksiran yang berikutnya. Pindaan seksyen 30"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/4/msa@/~sched_2__chp_V__para_23",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "23",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/4/msa@/~sched_2__chp_V",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta Petroleum (Cukai Pendapatan) 1967, yang disebut “Akta ibu” dalam Bab ini, dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas subseksyen 30(1) subseksyen yang berikut: “(1a) For the purposes of this section, a chargeable person shall furnish to the Director General a return in the prescribed form on an electronic medium or by way of electronic transmission in accordance with section 82a.”. Pindaan seksyen 30a"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/4/msa@/~sched_2__chp_V__para_24",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "24",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/4/msa@/~sched_2__chp_V",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta ibu dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas subseksyen 30a(1) subseksyen yang berikut: “(1a) For the purposes of this section, a chargeable person shall furnish to the Director General a return in the prescribed form on an electronic medium or by way of electronic transmission in accordance with section 82a.”. Pindaan seksyen 30b"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/4/msa@/~sched_2__chp_V__para_25",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "25",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/4/msa@/~sched_2__chp_V",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta ibu dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas subseksyen 30B(1) subseksyen yang berikut: “(1a) For the purposes of this section, a chargeable person shall furnish to the Director General an amended return in the prescribed form on an electronic medium or by way of electronic transmission in accordance with section 82a.”. Seksyen baharu 30c"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/4/msa@/~sched_2__chp_V__para_26",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "26",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/4/msa@/~sched_2__chp_V",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta ibu dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas seksyen 30B seksyen yang berikut: “Amendment of return on expenditure during exploration period 30c. (1) Where for an exploration period a chargeable person has furnished a return in accordance with subsection 30a(1), that person may make amendment to such return in an amended return as prescribed by the Director General in respect of the amount of exploration expenditure incurred by that chargeable person in relation to petroleum operations in the exploration period. (2) An amended return under subsection (1) shall only be made after the due date for the furnishing of the return pursuant to subsection 30a(1), but not later than six months from that date. (3) For the purposes of this section, the amended return shall— (a) specify the amount or additional amount of exploration expenditure incurred by that chargeable person in relation to petroleum operations in that period; or (b) contain such particulars as may be required by the Director General. (4) The amendment under subsection (1) shall only be made once.”. Pindaan seksyen 82a"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/4/msa@/~sched_2__chp_V__para_27",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "27",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/4/msa@/~sched_2__chp_V",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan subseksyen 82a(1) dengan subseksyen yang berikut: “(1) Any chargeable person— (a) shall, if so required under this Act; or (b) may, if so allowed by the Director General, furnish any form prescribed under this Act (in this section referred to as the “prescribed form”) on an electronic medium or by way of an electronic transmission.”."
      }
    }
  ]
}
